    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Customize your character: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character's background, choose your talent, assign attribute points, build your character's advantage, is a hundred steps through the sharpshooter, or the mighty strongman, or the swift raider, everything is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/505a17c23cdb0f1cb33dc91f137227e8.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=608 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/505a17c23cdb0f1cb33dc91f137227e8.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/505a17c23cdb0f1cb33dc91f137227e8.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Arm your character: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich equipment system, each piece of equipment has visual changes, and has different parts of the protective effect, please do a good job of protection, to meet the deadly attack of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7d004fb5ed688ecdc8e52e54d0c7e026.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=608 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7d004fb5ed688ecdc8e52e54d0c7e026.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7d004fb5ed688ecdc8e52e54d0c7e026.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Modify your weapon: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of basic firearms and melee weapons, you can modify and maintain your weapons, and good marauders need to maintain their weapons regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/9a8a8af226b46143ec76a6566159d793.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=608 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/9a8a8af226b46143ec76a6566159d793.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/9a8a8af226b46143ec76a6566159d793.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various types of zombies:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ordinary zombies to specially dressed zombies to mutants, different zombies have different abilities, some are numerous, some are as fast as the wind, some are as strong as a rock, and some are extremely deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/0f99734a4f0122124445e707e79d5c28.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=608 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/0f99734a4f0122124445e707e79d5c28.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/0f99734a4f0122124445e707e79d5c28.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Explore restricted areas full of danger: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Houses, apartments, police stations, supermarkets, different scenes will have different material distribution, and contains some secrets, according to the needs of the plan your route of action, and safe evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/02860206f497394692fb37a499ffc274.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=608 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/02860206f497394692fb37a499ffc274.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/02860206f497394692fb37a499ffc274.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Run your base: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather supplies to expand and upgrade your camp, build workstations, planter boxes, hunting grounds, water purifiers and other facilities, and get the essentials for survival. Make tools to help you survive on this dangerous island. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New battle display:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/823827e3e5fcef33e254ced9b2fb8423.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=540 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/823827e3e5fcef33e254ced9b2fb8423.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/823827e3e5fcef33e254ced9b2fb8423.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/1aba2e6cf706c1c47a688308f9042ff8.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=540 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/1aba2e6cf706c1c47a688308f9042ff8.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/1aba2e6cf706c1c47a688308f9042ff8.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7007670302ca9b15e9177ffe5109662c.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=540 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7007670302ca9b15e9177ffe5109662c.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/7007670302ca9b15e9177ffe5109662c.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather system display:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rainy night\uff1aBecause the full moon is relatively bright and the field of view is relatively clear, the regular weather will occasionally rain or rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/ce72cf4122bb3cb15cfb7bc55340364b.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/ce72cf4122bb3cb15cfb7bc55340364b.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/ce72cf4122bb3cb15cfb7bc55340364b.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar eclipse\uff1aBecause the moonlight is obscured, the whole area is covered by the dark night, if you do not rely on the light will not be able to see anything, you do not know what danger is hidden in the night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/f7cb6541cb034d3d7f8c30efdd6be6a4.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/f7cb6541cb034d3d7f8c30efdd6be6a4.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/f7cb6541cb034d3d7f8c30efdd6be6a4.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Moon&amp;Blood Rain\uff1aThe bloody full moon dyed the whole world into a hell-like blood color, and sometimes it rained blood. Under the influence of the blood moon, all zombies will become more bloodthirsty, move faster, and hurt higher. Be careful, it is very dangerous to go out in the blood Moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/174736ffac1c270edf6af7dd6c524708.poster.avif?t=1749932960\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/174736ffac1c270edf6af7dd6c524708.webm?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010060/extras/174736ffac1c270edf6af7dd6c524708.mp4?t=1749932960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For feedback and suggestions: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in the early access stage, and there are still some functions and capabilities in our plan that have not been developed yet. At present, there are only two people in the team, and we need about two years to complete the development of the official version. Please give us feedback and help, so that we can complete the development of the complete version together.For more questions about early access, please read the &quot;Early Access Game&quot; section on the header. Thank you for your support.</p>",
